1
00:00:00,104 --> 00:00:01,484
Treatment Rankings.

2
00:00:01,484 --> 00:00:04,284
Currently, your doctor picks treatments based on:

3
00:00:04,284 --> 00:00:05,984
that drug rep who brought good donuts

4
00:00:05,984 --> 00:00:07,744
in two thousand and three,

5
00:00:07,744 --> 00:00:09,204
something they half-remember from medical

6
00:00:09,204 --> 00:00:11,544
school, whatever the insurance company

7
00:00:11,544 --> 00:00:14,524
allows, and vibes.

8
00:00:14,524 --> 00:00:16,884
This is called "evidence-based medicine,"

9
00:00:16,884 --> 00:00:18,724
which contains the word "evidence"

10
00:00:18,724 --> 00:00:20,344
the same way "grape soda"

11
00:00:20,344 --> 00:00:22,144
contains the word "grape.".

12
00:00:22,244 --> 00:00:23,844
Your decentralized F.D.A.

13
00:00:23,844 --> 00:00:25,964
will rank every treatment by what actually

14
00:00:25,964 --> 00:00:29,004
happened to real humans who took it:

15
00:00:29,004 --> 00:00:30,704
Outcome Labels.

16
00:00:30,704 --> 00:00:32,684
Food has nutrition labels.

17
00:00:32,684 --> 00:00:34,724
Cigarettes have warning labels.

18
00:00:34,724 --> 00:00:36,824
Drugs have forty-page inserts written

19
00:00:36,824 --> 00:00:38,964
by lawyers having seizures, which

20
00:00:38,964 --> 00:00:41,344
nobody reads, including your doctor.

21
00:00:41,344 --> 00:00:43,604
Your television advertisements show a smiling

22
00:00:43,604 --> 00:00:45,864
human frolicking through a meadow while

23
00:00:45,864 --> 00:00:47,464
a voiceover lists ways the drug

24
00:00:47,464 --> 00:00:49,864
might kill you at auctioneer speed.

25
00:00:49,864 --> 00:00:50,964
The meadow human does not

26
00:00:50,964 --> 00:00:52,664
react to the word "stroke."

27
00:00:53,464 --> 00:00:55,384
Side effects include "death," listed between

28
00:00:55,384 --> 00:00:57,784
"constipation" and "mild rash," as if

29
00:00:57,784 --> 00:00:59,284
your organs failing is roughly as

30
00:00:59,284 --> 00:01:01,364
inconvenient as dry skin.

31
00:01:01,524 --> 00:01:03,104
The label says "individual results

32
00:01:03,104 --> 00:01:05,084
may vary," meaning outcomes range

33
00:01:05,084 --> 00:01:07,464
from "cured" to "deceased"

34
00:01:07,464 --> 00:01:09,224
(both technically qualifying).

35
00:01:09,544 --> 00:01:11,384
It also says "ask your doctor,"

36
00:01:11,384 --> 00:01:12,644
but your doctor has seven minutes

37
00:01:12,644 --> 00:01:14,324
per appointment and just Googled your

38
00:01:14,324 --> 00:01:16,084
condition in the hallway.

39
00:01:16,244 --> 00:01:18,304
Your new system will produce Outcome Labels

40
00:01:18,304 --> 00:01:20,384
that tell you what actually happens when

41
00:01:20,384 --> 00:01:22,504
real humans take a drug.

42
00:01:22,504 --> 00:01:23,084
Not what a marketing

43
00:01:23,084 --> 00:01:25,064
department hopes happens.

44
00:01:25,064 --> 00:01:25,704
Not what a lawyer

45
00:01:25,704 --> 00:01:28,124
is comfortable admitting happens.

46
00:01:28,124 --> 00:01:29,600
What happens.
